 "description": "1U horizontal cable manager, FS SKU #120680: a flat black steel panel on the rack rails with five detachable polycarbonate D-rings that twist into round seats in it and stand 85.5 mm out. Each ring is a long braced loop whose front end curls back under itself, and a cable is laid in through the slit the curl leaves.",
