   "note": "drawing - 430 x 44 x 97.7. The plate is flat over the whole 19 in [482.6mm] and its top and bottom edges fold back over 16.93 in [430mm], 1.04 in [26.3mm] in from each end; the flat ends outside the folds are the ears, which this library does not draw, so the body is the 430. Both datasheets' tables give the depth as 3.37 in (85.5 mm): the D-rings datasheet's side view shows that this is the ring from the face of the plate, and dimensions 3.85 in [97.7mm] from the back of the folded edges to the front of the ring, which is the envelope."
  },
  "color": {
