   "note": "drawing - `positions` states where the ears bolt, for the Rack Builder. The ears are the flat ends of the panel, so the ear plane is the panel face, and the rings stand 85.5 mm in front of it (the vendor's side view, datasheet page 4, 3.37 in [85.5mm]). `at` is 85.5. Of the 97.7 depth, 12.2 stands behind the rail. This states a placement; no dimension changed."
  },
  "front": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - the front view of the D-rings datasheet: the plate between the folds and the five rings on their seats. Rings centred 35 mm from the left fold and 90 apart: the drawing dimensions 1.04 in [26.3mm] plus 1.38 in [35.1mm] to the first ring's centre and 3.54 in [90mm] between centres, and the five read 90.0 mm apart, symmetric about the middle. The ring's contract has the rest. FS's mark, printed on the plate just inside the left fold, is not drawn: a vendor mark never is."
  },
  "full-depth": {
