   "note": "FIGURES FIRST, FROM THE VENDOR'S OWN DIMENSIONED DRAWINGS. Two FS datasheets draw the part. The Horizontal Cable Managers with D-rings datasheet has a side view and a front view dimensioned in inches with millimetres in brackets: the front view is 2.161 px/mm across from the 482.6 line (1043 px) and 2.205 down from the 44 (97 px), a 2 % difference between the axes, and its 430, 90 and 35.1 lines agree with the across scale to under a millimetre. FS's 0U/1U Horizontal Cable Manager datasheet draws the same part with 482.4, 465, 31.5 and 97.4; the 0.3 mm between the two is drawing, not part, and the D-rings datasheet's figures are taken."
